# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Build context for the Adlytic runtime image.
#
#  WHY THIS WAS REWRITTEN
#  Nixpacks runs `COPY . /app` THREE times, so every megabyte in this context
#  is paid for three times in image layers — and layers are what "Publishing
#  image" spends its minutes uploading.
#
#  The repository is not one project. It carries `review/` (14MB of audit
#  material), `hub/`, `platform/`, `dawai-platform/`, `dawai-site/`,
#  `qareeb-platform/`, `docs/` and `public/adspulse/` — none of which the
#  Adlytic server imports or serves. Verified, not assumed: zero `src/`
#  imports reference any of them, and the only static routes are /fonts,
#  /icons, /manifest.json, /sw.js and /vendor.
#
#  Also corrected: Docker's ignore patterns are NOT recursive. `*.md` matched
#  only root-level files, so every .md under docs/ and the sibling projects
#  was being copied in despite the rule that looked like it excluded them.
#  The patterns below use `**/` where recursion is what was meant.
#
#  RULE FOR EDITING: this file is an allow-nothing-by-accident list. If you
#  add a directory to the repo, decide whether the RUNTIME needs it. If it
#  does not, add it here.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Git & tooling ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.cursor
.claude
.github

# ── Dependencies & build output (rebuilt in the container) ──────────────
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
.playwright
playwright-report
test-results

# ── Local env & secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Tests & dev scripts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
test_*.ts
test_*.mjs
tests
e2e
playwright.config.ts
*.command
scripts/compileMasterAuditPdf.ts

# ── SIBLING PROJECTS — not the Adlytic runtime ──────────────────────────
# Each is its own deployable; the server neither imports nor serves them.
hub
platform
dawai-platform
dawai-site
qareeb-platform
review
docs
public/adspulse

# The iOS client (Project Alpha). A separate Expo/React Native package with
# its own package.json and lockfile; the server image builds none of it, so
# letting it into the build context would only slow every production build.
# Its release pipeline is mobile/eas.json, not this Dockerfile.
mobile

# ── Rendered/audit artefacts (regenerated on demand, never shipped) ─────
.mobile-pages
.desktop-shots
.desktop-findings.json

# ── Docs, audits, logs — recursive, because *.md alone is root-only ─────
**/*.md
**/*.txt
**/*.pdf
**/*.log
**/*.sh
AUDIT_*
ADLYTIC_*
ARCHITECTURE_*
DEPLOY*
EXPLORE*
RAILWAY_*
SESSION_*
SYNC_*
HOW_IT_*
CMO_*
COMPLETION_*
alpha_*

# ── Uploads / artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
uploads
artifacts
tmp
